PREFIX : <https://arco.ai/ontology/core#>
PREFIX iao: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_>
PREFIX cco: <http://www.ontologyrepository.com/CommonCoreOntologies/>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>

# AUDIT LAYER ONLY — flag, not classification.
#
# Returns TRUE when:
#   (a) the system is entailed as AnnexIII5bApplicableSystem (creditworthiness), AND
#   (b) the system's IntendedUseSpecification prescribes a FraudDetectionProcess token.
#
# Condition (b) reflects the explicit legal carve-out in Annex III 5(b):
# "with the exception of AI systems used for the purpose of detecting financial fraud."
#
# A system satisfying both conditions may qualify for the 5(b) fraud exclusion.
# This query does NOT determine whether the exclusion applies — that requires
# human legal judgment about whether fraud detection is the primary purpose.
#
# If TRUE, the certificate emits FLAGGED and directs human review.
# OWL classification (AnnexIII5bApplicableSystem) is UNCHANGED by this flag.
#
# The pipeline substitutes :Sentinel_ID_System with the actual system IRI
# when --system is provided.

ASK WHERE {
  :Sentinel_ID_System rdf:type :AnnexIII5bApplicableSystem .

  ?ius rdf:type :IntendedUseSpecification ;
       iao:0000136 :Sentinel_ID_System ;
       cco:prescribes ?proc .

  ?proc rdf:type :FraudDetectionProcess .
}
